# Authored on Windows, built on Unix CI runners (macOS and Ubuntu). Force LF on
# everything a runner executes: a CRLF `run:` block turns bash heredoc
# terminators (EOF, PY) into EOF, which never matches its opener, and $( )
# substitutions inherit a trailing . It fails in ways that look nothing like
# a line-ending problem. core.autocrlf usually normalises the committed blob,
# but only this makes it deterministic regardless of contributor git config.
* text=auto

*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
